[{"title":"怀欧子建","author":"李孙宸","text":"病耽高卧稳，寂寂掩柴荆。\n远道长怀汝，清秋一寄声。\n风尘销翰藻，岁月老时名。\n夙昔襟期在，宁终负此生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28820,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"羊城病中七夕","author":"李孙宸","text":"枕簟凉风入，他乡七夕秋。\n无朋问沽酒，独坐望牵牛。\n延想星河近，微吟风露收。\n兹宵病客梦，应傍故山楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28821,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初秋邓伯乔招同诸子集梁明府西园","author":"李孙宸","text":"西郊带长薄，一径草亭欹。\n野旷秋声早，林空落照迟。\n悠然清兴发，共惬白云期。\n莫厌归途晚，红尘骑马随。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28822,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初秋同欧子建邓伯乔过朱季美虹冈别业","author":"李孙宸","text":"北郭寻幽赏，名园倚岫开。\n风林失午暑，阴壑送秋雷。\n洒扫云间石，同倾竹下杯。\n酒酣欢未已，欲去更徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28823,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋无月诸从同戴公纶过酌 其一","author":"李孙宸","text":"飘泊经年意，秋来两鬓残。\n那期今夜酒，得共故园欢。\n明没星河失，朦胧桂影寒。\n清光还可待，秉烛话更阑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28824,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋无月诸从同戴公纶过酌 其二","author":"李孙宸","text":"节是吾家会，筵邀上客欢。\n流光增感慨，良夜且盘桓。\n芳桂迎风冷，残倚怯露漙。\n解识清秋意，光辉淡处看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28825,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初冬同伍国开兄弟雨中寻梅","author":"李孙宸","text":"闻道江梅好，相期江水滨。\n不辞微雨湿，为觅淡妆人。\n蕊似含情待，枝偷剌眼新。\n何须看庾岭，数朵不胜春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28826,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋杪再同诸子登落霞峰醉中赠有开","author":"李孙宸","text":"未尽登高兴，重来结伴游。\n江山仍旧识，寒意改深秋。\n席地妨樵径，扳花作酒筹。\n醉忘归路远，还为夕阳留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28827,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初冬同诸从偕戴公纶泛舟过隔溪矶上坐饮","author":"李孙宸","text":"沿流寻所适，舍艇入林隈。\n觅坐全依草，贪眠不避苔。\n山禽衔果落，溪月涌潮来。\n何事枌榆地，长年负酒杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28828,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"已酉秋杪还山伍国开有开何景言诸子过访","author":"李孙宸","text":"归来三径在，寂寞见吾真。\n谁道无知己，犹能枉故人。\n穷途交有态，秋色暮逾新。\n已谢尘羁束，青尊肯厌贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28829,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大观亭集","author":"李孙宸","text":"十年桑梓地，开社枕溪流。\n及此漂零日，狂歌得共游。\n望云怜鸟疾，临水羡鱼浮。\n乍解风尘色，何妨尽醉留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28830,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送何龙友北上","author":"李孙宸","text":"忽忆莺花好，乘春集凤池。\n风云失计日，湖海送君时。\n短鬓怜秋色，穷交少旧知。\n功名非俗物，行矣爱前期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28831,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送黎有道远游","author":"李孙宸","text":"最怜物外侣，磊落几如君。\n生计馀诗卷，行踪半水云。\n无心恋瓮牖，有路出尘氛。\n一别家山去，音书何处闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28832,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦雨","author":"李孙宸","text":"经旬怀不展，积雨笑天痴。\n兀坐忘昏晓，閒愁感岁时。\n潦田妨稼穑，门巷泛鸬鹚。\n徙倚空庭晚，酣歌转自疑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28833,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邓伯乔远还寄讯二首 其一","author":"李孙宸","text":"念尔频惊梦，欣逢返旧林。\n艰危身尚在，去住感何深。\n花鸟归人赋，渔樵倦客心。\n可能移雪棹，乘兴泛山阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28834,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邓伯乔远还寄讯二首 其二","author":"李孙宸","text":"自得淩江信，经年断尺书。\n生涯那可问，浪迹竟何如。\n岁月潘郎鬓，风烟楚泽渔。\n山川修复阻，疑望涕盈袪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28835,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春见新月","author":"李孙宸","text":"经旬愁积雨，乍见吐残规。\n照水翻成练，窥妆欲上眉。\n闷怀云影散，幽韵草光披。\n三匝南飞鸟，栖栖未定枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28836,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同诸弟新年游水月庵","author":"李孙宸","text":"行春随所适，少涉即禅林。\n花雾分香霭，泉声杂梵音。\n云霞如有想，水月本无心。\n顿觉劳生久，慈航此地寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28837,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贺伍伯翔新婚","author":"李孙宸","text":"春仲融和日，春风啼鸟频。\n月怜眉黛巧，花妒绮罗新。\n醉益怀中语，欢疑梦后身。\n风光有如此，应自爱芳辰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28838,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬夜与戴公纶诸子泛月","author":"李孙宸","text":"泛泛定何适，怜幽每驻桡。\n得林仍见月，维岸亦听潮。\n把酒飘零失，狂歌意气骄。\n鸣榔且归去，野寺报钟遥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28839,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早起","author":"李孙宸","text":"鸡声梦初觉，渐听晓钟稀。\n乍惬晨飔爽，犹怜夜色微。\n步林栖鸟散，扫径白云飞。\n万虑何曾感，焚香未启扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28840,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何龙友苦熟患疮见寄二诗赋答 其一","author":"李孙宸","text":"无处堪逃暑，幽居漫掩扉。\n雨声来伏枕，兰气染初衣。\n念此经时别，还怜问询稀。\n浪传君苦热，郢雪冷然飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28841,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何龙友苦熟患疮见寄二诗赋答 其二","author":"李孙宸","text":"暑兼杯酒废，懒任故人疏。\n尔自思河朔，诗来问敝庐。\n烟霞容寄傲，日月老閒居。\n未忘千秋事，青山待著书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28842,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得欧子建书寄答","author":"李孙宸","text":"一卧乡园僻，思君又岁寒。\n别来仍落魄，书到慰加餐。\n日月虚鸿宝，乾坤负钓竿。\n清江秋事好，谁与采芳兰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28843,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋后一日园亭闻蝉","author":"李孙宸","text":"荏苒秋过半，开尊坐暮林。\n玄蝉衰柳外，作意送悲音。\n露冷声偏苦，风寒响易沈。\n听来翻自感，不那岁时心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28844,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重游瑞虞龙友别业","author":"李孙宸","text":"十年一俯仰，兹地复同游。\n偃蹇怜生事，萧条感素秋。\n新霜凋蕙草，寒雨散江鸥。\n但惬丘中赏，宁悲白日流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28845,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"驼山寻梅重别俞氏兄弟","author":"李孙宸","text":"岁有梅花候，今年开独迟。\n长林犹带叶，冷蕊未盈枝。\n日暖蜂犹趁，林深鸟屡窥。\n归人不可住，攀折有馀思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28846,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦楼中早起","author":"李孙宸","text":"绕槛林霏雾，当窗山送霞。\n真疑瑶树长，手自掇三花。\n日月催人事，烟云换岁华。\n呼童荐椒酒，春意在吾家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28847,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚泊西南驿","author":"李孙宸","text":"行程悬万里，傍晚一停桡。\n驿号西南古，人怜岐路遥。\n冷风侵短褐，新月涌初潮。\n去去庾关近，梅香早己飘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28848,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒南华","author":"李孙宸","text":"宝地烟霞辟，西天法界开。\n谁知偕计日，得及谒师来。\n发藏探灵秘，观空上玉台。\n所怜明发路，愿借渡江杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28849,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清远峡","author":"李孙宸","text":"推蓬望长峡，逆水进扁舟。\n夹岸攒江耸，孤泉界壁流。\n樵歌传牧竖，山果弄猕猴。\n辍棹还登陟，寻幽到上头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28850,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"度庾岭寄同社诸子","author":"李孙宸","text":"庾关初度日，雪色满山春。\n乍惬扳梅想，翻怜赠别人。\n虹光望白社，龙剑隔延津。\n寄尔一枝去，应怀京洛尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28851,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"皖城舟中立春","author":"李孙宸","text":"滞留怜雨雪，道路喜逢春。\n湖海扁舟日，乡园万里人。\n尊盘随俗赏，梅柳上枝新。\n渐觉风光好，莺花望紫宸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28852,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得山城犬吠云","author":"李孙宸","text":"荒城三五户，篱落自成村。\n每觉云惊犬，虚疑客到门。\n近窗搅午梦，传谷应空喧。\n乐土相闻处，风犹大古存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28853,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得起坐弹鸣琴","author":"李孙宸","text":"夜静群动息，悠然百感侵。\n我怀无所托，揽衣调素琴。\n掩抑调中恨，凄清弦外心。\n松风时扣户，错讶到知音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28854,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得十五颇有馀","author":"李孙宸","text":"丽质本多姿，年光复在兹。\n低眉初舞袖，织手学调丝。\n佻达何曾惯，骄羞强自持。\n清光三五在，团扇未须疑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28855,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得江清月近人","author":"李孙宸","text":"水天秋一色，夜月净涓涓。\n似练涵青镜，如轮动碧川。\n鱼龙听醉语，鸟鹊绕寒烟。\n莫向楼头妇，清宵照独眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28856,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得归山独鸟迟","author":"李孙宸","text":"为巢原避弋，人外托幽閒。\n野旷无朝暮，天空信往还。\n乘风犹逐侣，见月始归山。\n藜杖忘机者，相随亦掩关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28857,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得客至始梳头","author":"李孙宸","text":"竹径萧森地，逃喧与世违。\n僻居无驷马，卒岁懒裳衣。\n偶闻幽侣至，理发向斜晖。\n岂为妨高枕，翻怜雅会稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28858,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得冬花","author":"李孙宸","text":"亦随群卉植，不共众葩荣。\n质自含冰结，香缘濯雪清。\n铅华迟暮思，裘马冶游情。\n安得岁寒侣，幽芳共结盟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28859,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得砚","author":"李孙宸","text":"阴山有紫玉，剖璞更多奇。\n染墨云生石，濡毫花弄池。\n草玄知不负，守黑欲何为。\n若作王郎论，应从四璧窥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28860,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得荷露","author":"李孙宸","text":"霏洒何曾见，凝荷始著珠。\n日边光乍闪，风际有还无。\n瓣湿何郎粉，香浮妃子酥。\n若耶溪畔女，双腕几沾濡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28861,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"禁林春望 其一","author":"李孙宸","text":"禁城开晓望，曙色乱晴阴。\n柳暗春藏陌，花明暖到林。\n条风翻戏蝶，淑景动鸣禽。\n最是宸游地，春来雨露深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28862,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"禁林春望 其二","author":"李孙宸","text":"上苑春光早，登台望杳然。\n有花皆笑日，无柳不含烟。\n绮陌莺初啭，金河雁未旋。\n阳和均万户，长与奉尧天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28863,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五日忆江南","author":"李孙宸","text":"燕台逢午节，转忆故园欢。\n艾酒邀邻舍，兰舟竞急湍。\n绮罗蘸水影，歌管入云端。\n漫说兵堪辟，烽烟道路难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28864,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早春赠苏汝载山人","author":"李孙宸","text":"十年意气侣，转自帝城亲。\n傲骨终成我，浮名肯傍人。\n冥鸿千古意，呼马此时身。\n为问胡姬酒，春来醉几巡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28865,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送郭冲甫别驾之任岳州","author":"李孙宸","text":"风流看佐郡，揽辔佩刀新。\n谁念缁尘客，分携白社人。\n湖光澄浩淼，岳色映嶙峋。\n知尔登楼处，临风把酒频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28866,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立秋先一日同韩寅仲苏汝载罗敦翰集樊孟泰署分赋","author":"李孙宸","text":"留滞京华久，惊心一叶风。\n莼鲈乡思远，尊酒故人同。\n习懒时名减，谈高夜色空。\n惟应同调者，杯底日过从。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28867,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄怀黎群献","author":"李孙宸","text":"一从江上别，万里各风烟。\n去住心宁异，交亲意自怜。\n梦归芳草渚，人远白云天。\n秋雁南来少，应无只字传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28868,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋后一夕韩太史林广文曾比部汪黎二山人过集寓楼分赋","author":"李孙宸","text":"佳期来胜侣，多是故乡人。\n月过三秋半，情怜万里亲。\n风飘梧欲尽，露濯桂仍新。\n好友连宵赏，尊醪未厌频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28869,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴孝廉光卿初至韩绪仲先生招同曾元鲁黎不回夜集分赋 其一","author":"李孙宸","text":"薄宦逢迎少，招寻有弟兄。\n何期倾盖客，得惬入林情。\n促膝话桑梓，飞杯泛菊英。\n迟回怜夜色，新月上高城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28870,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴孝廉光卿初至韩绪仲先生招同曾元鲁黎不回夜集分赋 其二","author":"李孙宸","text":"论交无久暂，欢会慰天涯。\n情惬邱中赏，言多物外期。\n乡心砧杵急，秋色鬓毛知。\n拚醉兹宵酒，城头漏下迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28871,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴孝廉光卿初至韩绪仲先生招同曾元鲁黎不回夜集分赋 其三","author":"李孙宸","text":"节序重阳近，篱花数朵新。\n所怜今夜会，同是故园人。\n下榻情何剧，忘形语自真。\n醉听流水弄，一为涤缁尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28872,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴孝廉光卿初至韩绪仲先生招同曾元鲁黎不回夜集分赋 其四","author":"李孙宸","text":"秋色真宜夜，过从地复偏。\n谈高催换烛，坐久问装绵。\n月影寒移竹，雁声霜满天。\n醉来忘潦倒，欲别更留连。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28873,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄逢一得请还粤同曾元鲁过宿话别 其一","author":"李孙宸","text":"己恨分携促，还能此夜亲。\n因谈乡国事，悔作宦游人。\n雁掠征帆度，花迎候馆新。\n都门明日道，去住各酸辛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28874,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄逢一得请还粤同曾元鲁过宿话别 其二","author":"李孙宸","text":"萍梗真无定，天涯又一时。\n词人共清夜，归客况临岐。\n横被情偏洽，听鸡梦屡迟。\n话深天渐曙，谁忍听歌骊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28875,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪竹 其一","author":"李孙宸","text":"爱尔便娟质，还堪共岁寒。\n湘妃珠积泪，云母玉为冠。\n直节淩寒易，清标傅粉难。\n王猷恋幽赏，曾否剡溪看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28876,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪竹 其二","author":"李孙宸","text":"戛戛鸣残雨，漪漪傲晓阳。\n宋人失玉叶，梁苑有霓裳。\n扫月寒相映，淩烟黛罩光。\n他时郢客曲，应入凤萧长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28877,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"明月照积雪 其一","author":"李孙宸","text":"千门矜瑞雪，一镜映寒空。\n世界玲珑里，云山清净中。\n交辉逼庭树，隐耀入帘栊。\n此夕怀乡国，应迷度岭鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28878,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"明月照积雪 其二","author":"李孙宸","text":"阶前纷六出，岂落广寒花。\n自照金茎色，平连玉塞沙。\n近梅神共媚，浮练影俱斜。\n欲拟阳春曲，霓裳未可誇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28879,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送金德润出宰江阴","author":"李孙宸","text":"送君初出宰，万树发春萌。\n柳色辞寒浅，桃花到县明。\n庭阴閒吏事，溪水入琴声。\n只恐朝天日，难为借冠情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28880,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"署中杂咏 其一","author":"李孙宸","text":"自窃蓬瀛籍，长违丘壑年。\n宦途虽险仄，冰署少攀缘。\n紬书迎牖旭，载笔傍炉烟。\n迂拙真可补，还谈碣石天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28881,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"署中杂咏 其二","author":"李孙宸","text":"明时虽释褐，束带尚青袍。\n稍便趋迎少，兼无簿领劳。\n署连宫树密，坐对苑云高。\n自笑清华署，朝朝濡腐毫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28882,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"署中杂咏 其三","author":"李孙宸","text":"青藜吹太乙，天禄有藏书。\n秘欲探鸿宝，讹难辨鲁鱼。\n文章惭卤莽，岁月感居诸。\n相过同心友，高言间起予。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28883,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"署中杂咏 其四","author":"李孙宸","text":"清华供奉署，寂寞草玄庐。\n簪绂吾何有，烟霞意未除。\n清池花覆槛，白昼鸟窥书。\n细捡囊中草，淩云愧不如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28884,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过荏平县","author":"李孙宸","text":"故人为政地，四野足弦歌。\n租吏打门少，耕人驱犊多。\n花阴深卧阁，鹤径长垂萝。\n为问神仙宰，鸣琴意若何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28885,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南还途次感怀 其一","author":"李孙宸","text":"三载缁尘意，悠悠那可论。\n有官依玉署，无策献金门。\n暂适烟霞疾，难忘棫朴恩。\n暮云千里色，天际一凭轩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28886,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南还途次感怀 其二","author":"李孙宸","text":"往来关吏识，景物忆三年。\n荣利应何有，行藏信自然。\n马头冲毒热，徒驭饱风烟。\n计日乡园道，秋风鲈鲙边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28887,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南还途次感怀 其三","author":"李孙宸","text":"虚传韦杜曲，尺五去天居。\n近见丝纶府，还淹痛哭书。\n帝阍呼不达，谏院席全虚。\n窈有处堂虑，无言杞国愚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":28888,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]